    {
        "text": "The sky is a strange color."
    },
    {
        "text": "The sun is dark. The clouds are gray. The sky begins to split in the distance, the crack spreading along its center."
    },
    {
        "text": "But all this is no longer important."
    },
    {
        "text": "You remember this day."
    },
    {
        "text": "You can never forget it."
    },
    {
        "text": "It is like a prophecy destined to come true, one known by everyone."
    },
    {
        "text": "It is like a nightmare that can never be shaken, always entwining."
    },
    {
        "text": "You cannot tell if this is just a play."
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps your entire life is just a play, in the eyes of another."
    },
    {
        "text": "Abyss."
    },
    {
        "text": "You ask yourself."
    },
    {
        "text": "The actor on the stage must follow his script. But what about you?"
    },
    {
        "text": "What choice will you make?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
