    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_701_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't show mercy, Abyss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "The others would still be alive if I hadn't screwed up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have a chance to make things right. Bring back my head and\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up! Don't make me regret this!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_701_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't show mercy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then what am I supposed to do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm supposed to kill you, take your head and bring it back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bide my time, wait for the chance to take revenge...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, that's not right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Take this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_701_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your dagger...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take it. Go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_701_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Abyss!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you going to do, then, if you let me go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
