    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks for taking care of the kids for the past few days, young man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kind Villager"
    },
    {
        "text": "They say you're a great storyteller!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kind Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're welcome, sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're all good kids. We should be the ones thanking you for giving us a place to stay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_005"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, no, no, it was no trouble at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kind Villager"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll leave you to your work, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kind Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Telling stories to children?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like you're getting along well with the villagers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doesn't take much effort to move your mouth and tongue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, it takes patience I don't have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Things have been calm here, too calm. The mission's going too smoothly. I'm not used to this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Calm isn't bad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Certainly better than running into unexpected trouble...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know, I know, your dream is to retire quietly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have a gift for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? What is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$plot_intro",
        "key": "$plot_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "A round object falls on the ground before you."
    },
    {
        "text": "It is slightly rotten, and makes a dull thud as it lands."
    },
    {
        "text": "Your 'gift' rolls along on the ground, stopping at your feet."
    },
    {
        "text": "The gaze of its lifeless eyes meets yours."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I brought his weapon back, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is yours, isn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... why...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The one you let get away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Suddenly, the past catches up to you, just when you thought you'd finally escaped it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was the right decision to not kill him, Abyss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The right decision?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It makes the script even better.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the matter, Abyss? Isn't this the script you wrote for the troupe?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Script...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have nothing to do with the troupe! I ran away from it a long time ago!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't a script! It can't be!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
