    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#5$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "No...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was my own choice...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_701_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What choice?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you talking about, Abyss?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was... my own...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was right that I didn't kill you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_701_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know what's vexing you, but the best way is to kill me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "No need to take risks. Just carry out the plan\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no plan! It's not time for you to die yet!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go! I'll come with you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can all get out. We just need to be careful this time... don't get caught...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_701_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Calm down, Abyss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't escape. It was enough that I got to see you in the end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
