        "name": "avg_npc_701_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no other way, Abyss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kill me and take my head back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_701_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you hear me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kill me! We don't have time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kill you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_knife",
        "channel": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$blooddrop",
        "channel": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.8,
        "xstrength": 50,
        "ystrength": 50,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Put my dagger in your heart like this, and watch you die?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_701_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, that's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "You made the right choice, Abyss...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was it really my choice?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "What is choice?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "What are you?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Everything about 'Abyss' was created by the troupe. The 'self' that you had sought...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Does it really exist?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_indoor_u",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "ystrength": 40,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_knife",
        "channel": 1
    },
    {
