    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha... haha...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll die. I know you'll die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your head will inevitably be separated from your neck. I just hope it won't have to fall into the dust and dirt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why this time, I'll cut your head off myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that your prophecy, Abyss?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Head"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not a prophet. I just saw it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "I saw you die. You'll die, even if I let you go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "I ran, but I could never get away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course you can't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Head"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll never escape their eyes, no matter how well you hide.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Head"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Who's watching me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The audience, of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Head"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Audience... audience?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are they watching me? If I screw up, all they'll do is get rid of me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Certainly, there are those who are angry at your docile performance on stage. But that's to be expected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Head"
    },
    {
        "text": "We all know this is where the allure of art truly lies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Head"
    },
    {
        "text": "A good play with good actors should be able to move people's emotions, don't you think?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Head"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... that's not what it is! It can't be!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was my choice to let you go! It's not their will!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're really sure about that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Head"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then why are you still trapped in this nightmare?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Head"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why does that day keep repeating itself, even though you've already escaped?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Head"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do you keep trying anything you can to detach me from that body and bring me back with you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Head"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're afraid, Abyss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Head"
    },
    {
        "text": "Letting me go was your first and only act of defiance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Head"
    },
    {
        "text": "Running away from the troupe took all the courage you had.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Head"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Blood Diamond had come for you, but all you could do was hide.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Head"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were always more afraid of this all being part of some plan than of actually getting caught.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Head"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't like being seen, because you're afraid that your 'true self' doesn't actually exist here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Head"
    },
    {
        "text": "Am I wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Head"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut your trap.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
