    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "You're just a phantom in my dreams. You don't exist!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And don't call me Abyss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abyss"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't call me by that name!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "ystrength": 40,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_knife",
        "channel": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$blooddrop",
        "channel": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.05,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Poor thing. You couldn't kill your fear. You couldn't silence your doubts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broken Skull"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know it's anathema to seek the self.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broken Skull"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it can achieve great art!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broken Skull"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even now, you continue to contribute to the stage! They were wrong about you. You're a great actor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broken Skull"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up! I'm not acting!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll free myself from you. I'll kill you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't go back on stage. I'm not Abyss. My life is not a play!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "You and your tiny, tiny resolve.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broken Skull"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then let me ask you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broken Skull"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who are you, if not Abyss?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broken Skull"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
