    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shalem"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I'm here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shalem"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, I was distracted... did something happen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shalem"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What were you daydreaming about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not that it matters. It just sounded like you were talking to someone, so I came over and saw you staring into space.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You were hearing things. I'm the only one here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shalem"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no one else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shalem"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really? Guess I should get my hearing checked.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh yeah, \u25a0\u25a0.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What did you just call me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "\u25a0\u25a0"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? \u25a0\u25a0.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the matter? Isn't that your callsign?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Never mind that. Look\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have a gift for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4025_aprot2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "\u25a0\u25a0"
    },
    {
        "text": "A gift?",
